{
    "word": "hotbox",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                "word": "hotbox",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "90f6d4c1-5c12-48ac-95cc-6bd71a228c7c",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hotboxes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A container maintained at elevated temperatures in order to heat or cook its contents."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ef54096-ed58-4151-8327-629ef5324578",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "We made a hundred pizzas with a variety of toppings and put them in hotboxes — portable sterno heaters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dde4172-46aa-4200-af19-13a0b5099d7b",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "A hotbox is made from two nonflammable, insulated bags ( resembling mini beanbags ) and works like this: you place semi - cooked, hot food into the hotbox and the retained heat will complete the cooking process ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05a188a6-639a-4475-84a6-0b9903c470ab",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "They collected the food – each meal on two covered tin plates and the whole lot contained in large metal hotboxes – from the old people's home, Wisteria Lodge."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f13a05f9-9138-4b91-9e8f-4818bba0d0e5",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "First, in the early 1860s, he dabbled with hotboxes—simple devices that used a wooden box with a glass lid to trap heat from the sun."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df877b9-acf1-49a3-a9c6-50480abd21f0",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "A hotbox is a wonderful way to slow-cook your food. And it saves lots of electricity too."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f575ec0-92db-41ba-ba39-615d1e6bbb6a",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "As I looked around the living room, there were 2 hotboxes and a kadai covered with an aluminium plate kept at the coffee table. By the time I walked towards the hotboxes to check what's inside, Rashmi came outside from the kitchen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f14c607-0652-453e-9339-d0f2722d18d3",
                                "sense_id": "c8375256-1807-36e6-9451-6c5802703be3",
                                "text": "Eager 'fang farriers' hurried forward to scrape the bottoms of the hotboxes and dixies of everything that was left."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83b2f586-27c1-3b5d-a98c-9529ffe1e992",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A container maintained at elevated temperatures in order to heat or cook its contents.",
                            "An oven."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8140cc77-f9c3-3164-880c-4b7408b68a4f",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An overheated shaft bearing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "edba4311-a105-453c-94fe-6b932ff8056b",
                                "sense_id": "8140cc77-f9c3-3164-880c-4b7408b68a4f",
                                "text": "If a hotbox is not discovered early, the temperature of the journal or bearing may rise to a critical level, so that the wheel end of the journal may burn off and cause a derailment of the car."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "946330c3-8381-38ce-9dea-a428dd2f0303",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An overheated shaft bearing.",
                            "An overheated axle box, bearing and bearing enclosure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8776da45-d48b-4660-938a-b31512da0c4f",
                                "sense_id": "946330c3-8381-38ce-9dea-a428dd2f0303",
                                "text": "One of the ex-L. & Y.R. \"pugs\" displaced by diesels at Bank Hall, No. 51232, is going to Preston for employment on the dock lines there, but when en route on December 31 it ran out of water and also sustained a hot box, as a result of which it was detained at Bank Hall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "815332f3-1b4d-4d94-a3c8-b83d28301e18",
                                "sense_id": "946330c3-8381-38ce-9dea-a428dd2f0303",
                                "text": "In particular, hot boxes on freight trains are a persistent problem."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c297725-72d8-4e2f-a7f4-9034e23fad01",
                                "sense_id": "946330c3-8381-38ce-9dea-a428dd2f0303",
                                "text": "Experience with infrared hotbox detector installations has demonstrated the validity of the analysis."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A room or compartment that is kept artificially warm for some purpose."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "182f4f67-7886-4f9c-8883-a2140b7f8e92",
                                "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                                "text": "The hotbox should be located in the nearest vicinity of the sorting room. The hotbox is a chamber in which air can be heated to a temperature of about 60 ° C."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61d3bd5f-e127-40af-9530-54aa7b6622f0",
                                "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                                "text": "If a freeze-up happens, the inaccessible section is likely to freeze along with the section in the hotbox itself, and the tape gives you an emergency method of thawing it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9b61406-e08a-4b9b-8bd0-510c144d7abc",
                                "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                                "text": "The flatbed portion of the truck contains a “hotbox,\" a 110-cubic-foot (3.11-cubic-meter) insulated rectangular container with an integral propane heating unit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f6d182e-a735-4c1e-bfd3-88910d080602",
                                "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                                "text": "The hotbox was a room where the cheese was actually produced and put through a \"cooker,\" and where approximately 9 to 11 employees worked on a daily basis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e484a7d-a334-4adf-bacf-62c4b6b639c0",
                                "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                                "text": "One of Yoshida's first annual outdoor jobs was to prepare his hotboxes: rectangular pits he dug in the ground near his house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f88bfdf-36a3-4310-8cc9-82ed29d9ca7f",
                                "sense_id": "cbd1b40e-75d6-35f3-9e47-8405646b3ea2",
                                "text": "For Walter Blum, as well as for many others, the hotbox is the most unpleasant part of being a jockey."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "25c0337d-a6e1-38c6-8b52-dac4d620263a",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A room or compartment that is kept artificially warm for some purpose.",
                            "A cold frame containing compost that provides a limited amount of warmth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da89bc8c-19e6-4c92-bc23-1441da5d758f",
                                "sense_id": "25c0337d-a6e1-38c6-8b52-dac4d620263a",
                                "text": "The vines are 'bench=grafted' indoors, left for a time in hotboxes to enable the scar from the graft to heal, and then bedded out in special nurseries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d33ce1e2-d494-4199-b562-7aef37f9af83",
                                "sense_id": "25c0337d-a6e1-38c6-8b52-dac4d620263a",
                                "text": "Near-synonym: hotbed"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6abac262-e198-4db0-bb7c-1a4e41be13df",
                                "sense_id": "25c0337d-a6e1-38c6-8b52-dac4d620263a",
                                "text": "You can take what you want from these two hotboxes, because I'm only going to throw them out as manure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a03f203-d680-4d99-bf19-edb171d14b30",
                                "sense_id": "25c0337d-a6e1-38c6-8b52-dac4d620263a",
                                "text": "All are in need of volunteer labor to maintain enclosures and feed the animals, and each one has a wish list of items to help keep the sanctuary functioning—everything from hotboxes, jumbo-size Greenies, and canned dog food to ATVs,chain saws, and rolls of three-foot wire for dig guards and overhangs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "411e8948-f70d-465f-92b2-47f7137bb216",
                                "sense_id": "25c0337d-a6e1-38c6-8b52-dac4d620263a",
                                "text": "“Cold frames” with glass tops that could be sealed, were also called hotboxes (or hotbeds.)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c126532a-3e34-366c-8045-4d63f3577821",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A room or compartment that is kept artificially warm for some purpose.",
                            "A box for hot composting."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "47dd241d-125b-4a63-8ed8-dc12f3dc0a24",
                                "sense_id": "c126532a-3e34-366c-8045-4d63f3577821",
                                "text": "I have two Hotboxes for composting garden and kitchen waste."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45f974a8-e23a-334c-ae8f-a566d1eb86e7",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A room or compartment that is kept artificially warm for some purpose.",
                            "An incubator."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fccdcedf-d22c-44d1-b3b0-5ac0922e521c",
                                "sense_id": "45f974a8-e23a-334c-ae8f-a566d1eb86e7",
                                "text": "We didn't expect to start off our parenting journey by seeing our babies hooked up to all the machines and covered in tubes and tape—in the grand scheme of things, that time was short, and they were soon out of their hotboxes, and we were cuddling them every chance we got, which was only twice a day!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3acc7796-d81b-3dab-85f2-c59c3dd93cd5",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A room or house that becomes unbearably hot inside when the weather is hot."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9281b062-929a-4239-bac4-ab1667112238",
                                "sense_id": "3acc7796-d81b-3dab-85f2-c59c3dd93cd5",
                                "text": "With portholes and doors secured, the staterooms became hotboxes and the odor from the galley an unendurable stench."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6258a769-20d4-4970-bf5f-56883601f17a",
                                "sense_id": "3acc7796-d81b-3dab-85f2-c59c3dd93cd5",
                                "text": "To keep from becoming hotboxes, birdhouses need good ventilation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df59a719-541e-4d32-9570-5afba6c0a211",
                                "sense_id": "3acc7796-d81b-3dab-85f2-c59c3dd93cd5",
                                "text": "By contrast, the first-floor hotboxes – though reasonably priced at C36,000/48,000 for a single/double with fan, using a common shower – are best avoided unless you enjoy sweaty, sleepless nights."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba12be2a-069f-3309-987e-273dca654aa6",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small, hot, enclosure, used as a punishment for slaves or prisoners."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d01af6c-0c70-4135-b126-8f223647353f",
                                "sense_id": "ba12be2a-069f-3309-987e-273dca654aa6",
                                "text": "In recent years, it had been believed that hotboxes only existed in movies such as Cool Hand Luke and Bridge Over The River Kwai."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48658d7a-3859-4f0c-9f35-50ea10946386",
                                "sense_id": "ba12be2a-069f-3309-987e-273dca654aa6",
                                "text": "I must dress and go see what's going on with the slaves in the hotboxes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcb46068-01f5-456d-a834-2689126e3fa5",
                                "sense_id": "ba12be2a-069f-3309-987e-273dca654aa6",
                                "text": "It shot me back to days of youth when the churches were hotboxes, but the services were awe-stricken."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "25a0e52c-abb7-3246-aa69-c164f3688f3c",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A furnace or heat source for a building."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "346b7ab0-a6a1-4c54-a974-5889afecbbd0",
                                "sense_id": "25a0e52c-abb7-3246-aa69-c164f3688f3c",
                                "text": "We usually think in terms of \"hotboxes\" or furnaces on the surface of the Earth, nuclear or fossil fuel plants; indeed some people think in terms of solar furnaces in which power is generated and distributed to the consumer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a40bca4-f23a-44a8-9dba-f8a5e414c330",
                                "sense_id": "25a0e52c-abb7-3246-aa69-c164f3688f3c",
                                "text": "When combined, these three DIY “hotboxes“ introduce enough hot air into this home to carry 30 to 40 percent of the home heating load."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b3aed126-f8f3-36d2-9a82-71748fefcdbd",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A small, airtight space where people smoke marijuana in order to intensify the high."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "655a30a0-db6a-41b5-8e33-e87f0573b612",
                                "sense_id": "b3aed126-f8f3-36d2-9a82-71748fefcdbd",
                                "text": "The blackouts, the hangovers, the vomiting, the hotboxes, the detox, the shame, and the degradation."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e0584372-9232-3e61-9639-9265f451d07c",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A gas manifold that diverts hot gasses into a heat exchanger."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc36475f-ed92-44fc-af5c-f548270c7931",
                                "sense_id": "e0584372-9232-3e61-9639-9265f451d07c",
                                "text": "It is planned to take the existing ventilation system and use it to exhaust the areas outside of the hotboxes, but to have the new system take over for the various hotboxes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56b56cf7-4bdf-412e-b41f-335a44166a8c",
                                "sense_id": "e0584372-9232-3e61-9639-9265f451d07c",
                                "text": "But we certainly have looked at heat transfer, both in hotboxes and the static circumstances."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff95f639-dc63-479f-9e7c-4c4a7bc01f2f",
                                "sense_id": "e0584372-9232-3e61-9639-9265f451d07c",
                                "text": "The hotbox was dismantled in a series of mini campaigns using 40-200 amp plasma torches deployed both by remote rigs and manually."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f24d890-1f98-305a-b2e7-707084449aa5",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A soundproof box used to hold a camera in order to prevent the sound of its operation interfering with the recording of a film."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d845630-13e6-4cd3-80a1-3b814c81c6ec",
                                "sense_id": "1f24d890-1f98-305a-b2e7-707084449aa5",
                                "text": "The lack of microphone and camera mobility (cameras were placed in hotboxes so that their whirring sound would not be picked up) prevented the film-makers from handling the camera with ease, as they had done previously."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83652237-073f-4542-a87b-ea67922c168f",
                                "sense_id": "1f24d890-1f98-305a-b2e7-707084449aa5",
                                "text": "A loading room must be considered unsafe until tested, regardless of whether it is a permanent, temperature-controlled, air-filtered installation or a portable plywood \"hotbox” on a sound stage."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6ab54626-f2ec-35e5-9654-3b3d78218dbe",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A storage container for personal belongings of employees who are hot desking."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40640b55-e749-4e9b-aa3f-3071ad61dbd1",
                                "sense_id": "6ab54626-f2ec-35e5-9654-3b3d78218dbe",
                                "text": "Storage refers to the use of 'hotboxes' in which staff are required to place any personal belongings when they finish work; the aim of which is to ensure that staff no longer have a fixed place of work."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1b2ec6d-7cb6-3bad-a51e-e34330af13b7",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A location where controversial ideas are discussed or practiced."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2649f9a-fdbe-4ff5-b146-cedd211ab15d",
                                "sense_id": "c1b2ec6d-7cb6-3bad-a51e-e34330af13b7",
                                "text": "CMA's \"hotboxes\" give sources a chance to role-play before they face a real interview ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab1451d9-103d-4e6b-a36e-6d54cc97e58a",
                                "sense_id": "c1b2ec6d-7cb6-3bad-a51e-e34330af13b7",
                                "text": "In this way, these off-campus, nonprofit, nonacademic clubs increasingly influence the culture of colleges and universities nationwide, turning them into lockstep ideological hotboxes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9df3e4bc-f02c-3300-9ecd-8d3fa8510de6",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sexy woman."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "29af3565-0cbe-434c-9a82-e6b6acfce302",
                                "sense_id": "9df3e4bc-f02c-3300-9ecd-8d3fa8510de6",
                                "text": "They drove on with comments about \"redskin hotboxes who didn't wear any pants at all,\" and kept calling me \"chief\" in a sneering manner."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9f26109-331b-3be3-a545-f6092aadb37c",
                        "entry_id": "abe1f8d3-9373-3ff6-a056-10523a339893",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A context-sensitive dialog that duplicates many of the commands on the menu for users of the Maya Embedded Language."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a08f0619-8542-4fbb-b30a-f1a386cc5c67",
                                "sense_id": "a9f26109-331b-3be3-a545-f6092aadb37c",
                                "text": "While you can do everything you wish in Maya without ever using the hotbox, once you get used to the way the hotbox conserves space and puts nearly all of Maya's tools in easy reach, you'll wonder how you ever got along without it ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77663a3d-e146-4ea4-b880-a48364ee53ff",
                                "sense_id": "a9f26109-331b-3be3-a545-f6092aadb37c",
                                "text": "Another way to easily access menus is by using the hotbox, which appears when you press the spacebar."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52f0ab87-fbea-4455-aaff-566c3c0d797b",
                                "sense_id": "a9f26109-331b-3be3-a545-f6092aadb37c",
                                "text": "The features available in the hotbox further depend on the type of the object that is under the cursor when the hotbox is invoked."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "dace424b-07dd-33aa-a89e-1e5e6e1269e3",
                "word": "hotbox",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
